    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νήρ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of Nereus,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νήρεια τέκνα,</span> i.e. fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Euphro
				8.2
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηρός.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νήρειον</span></b> , τό, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δελφίνιον</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.73
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηρειάδιον</span></b> , ibid.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
